{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"centers\": [\n    {\n      \"options\": [\n        \"相握的双手留不住相聚的时光。\",\n        \"温柔的相聚留不住流逝的时光。\",\n        \"手心的温暖留不住流走的日子。\"\n      ],\n      \"center\": \"相握的双手留不住相聚的时光。\",\n      \"distinct_because\": \"核心是幸福仍在，却无法使它长久。矛盾来自相聚本身的短暂，不来自感情能否表达。\",\n      \"basis\": \"A中13份文章的最大共识；B中A1的解释力为89%，综合说服力8.5。保留幸福尚在时的隐痛，不引入实际告别或最终失去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"options\": [\n        \"热烈的心跳藏在克制的举止里。\",\n        \"颤动的指尖藏在从容的手势里。\",\n        \"急促的心跳藏在平静的微笑里。\"\n      ],\n      \"center\": \"热烈的心跳藏在克制的举止里。\",\n      \"distinct_because\": \"核心是强烈的深情与克制的表达始终并存。矛盾来自感情的强度与表达方式，不依赖幸福是否短暂。\",\n      \"basis\": \"A中6份文章的第二类理解；B中A2的解释力为86%，综合说服力8.5；C中亲密投入与自我控制持续互相牵制的候选。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3f6c3146-9ed1-4352-8805-7df6016fe6d8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261021T174911314809Z", "elapsed_seconds": 174.234, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T17:52:05.549939+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "97acebf168331689bcf9e4987f175fc0333580ad26490851d1c6c1a90578a779", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli